menu "GL30 experimental development"

config GL30_EXPERIMENTAL_MOTOR_CONTROL
    bool "Enable experimental motor commands"
    default n
    help
        Allow the USB MOTOR ARM command to enable the experimental menu
        control transmitter. This requires separately developed, paired
        STM32 firmware emitting HAPTIC_STATE (0x06) with the applied command
        nonce. The STM32 application on the current main branch does not
        emit that frame and is not a compatible peer for this experiment.

        This option does not establish hardware validation or change H25
        evidence. It is for explicit development experiments only. Leave
        it disabled for normal UI and display-performance builds: the UART
        still receives telemetry, MOTOR ARM is refused, and no motor
        command frames are transmitted.

endmenu
